1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,660
Once upon a time, there was a man who died.

2
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:09,380
All the stories the man spun came true.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,820
So the king, the nobility, and the kingdom's rich

4
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:16,400
all went to him to get him to write them stories.

5
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:19,940
But when they saw their wishes granted,

6
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:23,160
stark terror of his power seized them,

7
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:25,320
and they began to abhor him.

8
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:27,840
When the man finally died,

9
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:33,020
the people rejoiced that this wellspring of misfortune had dried up.

10
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:38,760
No one heard the echoing sound of the dead man's scornful laughter.

11
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:30,520
Did Muto get to go back to being the prince?

12
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:33,520
He defeated the Raven's Blood.

13
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:37,520
I get it, but Kyo wrote a story about Muto.

14
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:40,520
Oh, and Roo went back to being Roo, too.

15
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:42,520
I'm so glad.

16
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:44,520
I'm so glad.

17
