And I don't even know yet whether or not I still have the same power.

67
00:04:20,520 --> 00:04:25,520
Well, that's okay. Then do you want to get started on it now? The faster we help Myuto, right?

68
00:04:25,520 --> 00:04:28,520
It's not that everything I write comes true.

69
